00:54:26.770 --> 00:54:50.890
<v Tobin Low>Our managing editor is Sarah Abdurrahman. Our senior editors, David Kestenbaum and Nancy Updike. Special thanks this week to Betsy Johnson, Allan Phillips, Lindsay Naeder, and Marta Chmielowicz at Autism Speaks, Kory Andreas, Se Eun Gong, Leading Age, Melissa Honig, Evelyn Marte, Amina Dubuisson, Yves Vilas, and the other workers on TPS who shared their experiences with us.
